Z||000000||Earne||01-29-2000||11:17 AM||||I wanted to thank everyone that responded to my questions about T-Tops.  I also wanted to say that I bought them anyway.  They are not installed but they will be soon.  Came complete with brand new bags, locks & keys, and all the rest.  I have had one car with tops (Monte Carlo) and really liked it.  The special status of a Fiero with tops is even more of an enticement.<P>QUESTION:  There was a guy that was on the forum a lot, talking about his Turbo project.  Even Cliff was interested in possibly doing business.  Is he still around, was the project on the level, has it progressed, does anyone know what I'm talking about?  Sorry, that was a bunch of questions.  Anyway, if someone knows, I would appreciate an update.  Thanks again.||||reg||5
Z||000001||Standard||01-29-2000||04:59 PM||||Yeah, that was Stroker who was gonna make the Turbo kit.  Haven't heard from him for awhile.  Stroker, you out there?!?||||reg||1
